  "description": "The Holocaust was the systematic, state-sponsored persecution and murder of six million Jews by Nazi Germany and its collaborators during World War II. It is one of the most horrific genocides in human history and is central to the meme's darkly humorous and deeply insensitive juxtaposition. The reference to 'Auschwitz' specifically points to the largest and most infamous Nazi concentration and extermination camp.",
